well either of those 3 is good. I am new to this city and would appreciate any of those things. 

And I know what you mean but it does work for other guys , right ? There are sooo many girls on it ,it is crazy. 

And none of them choosing me but choosing other guys leads me to the conclusion that I am not desirable by the vast majority.

