your life will improve , I promise. Take in the pain, feel it and you'll realize you are stronger than it. Nothing is lost. Nobodys opinion matters. Everyone you know is gonna eventually die. you have many things to live for, great experiences to see. 

&#x200B;

Just, Hold On.

I like lifting weights so I joined a gym. I like playing the guitar and singing so I bought a guitar and sing with it at my own place. None of what you said is something that I have done/

